Releases a stale operation lock after checking that its runner has stopped

Usage: leptoskit infra unlock [OPTIONS] --owner <OWNER>

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --owner <OWNER>      
      --yes                
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
